   "summary": "📷: Presidential Communications Office via @luisacabatoINQ Follow our live updates here: https://t.co/FV0VxxJW2J LOOK: Lexus luxury vehicles to ferry Asean delegates Lexus Philippines is preparing luxury hybrid vehicles to transport delegates during the 49th Asean Summit in Metro Manila from Nov. Lula arrived in Manila on Friday for a two-day state visit and to attend the 49th Asean Summit and Related Summits on November 15 to 17.",
   "summary_zh": "📷：总统新闻办公室，经由@luisacabatoINQ。请在此关注我们的实时更新：https://t.co/FV0VxxJW2J 快看：Lexus豪华汽车将接送东盟代表。Lexus Philippines正准备豪华混合动力汽车，用于在11月于Metro Manila举行的第49届Asean Summit期间运送代表。Lula已于星期五抵达Manila，开始为期两天的国事访问，并参加11月15日至17日举行的第49届Asean Summit及相关峰会。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "On Saturday, Asean Business Advisory Council Chair Jose Ma. Concepcion III urged big businesses to help uplift smaller businesses across Southeast Asia. Speaking before hundreds of business executives at the Asean Investment Summit, Concepcion said the region’s prosperity must be practical and palpable, particularly for micro, small and medium enterprises (MSMEs). LOOK: More photos from the bilateral meeting between President Ferdinand Marcos Jr. and Canadian Prime Minister Mark Carney at the Philippine International Convention Center in Pasay City. The meeting marked a major milestone in Philippines-Canada trade relations, with both countries concluding negotiations for a Free Trade Agreement aimed at expanding trade and economic opportunities. | 📷: Presidential Communications Office via @luisacabatoINQ Follow our live updates here: https://t.co/FV0VxxJW2J LOOK: Lexus luxury vehicles to ferry Asean delegates Lexus Philippines is preparing luxury hybrid vehicles to transport delegates during the 49th Asean Summit in Metro Manila from Nov. 15 to 17. The fleet includes Lexus LS 500h sedans and LM 350h luxury vans for official delegates and dialogue partner representatives. All vehicles are on loan and will be returned after the country’s Asean hosting period, the company said. | 📷: Lexus Philippines/Facebook via @gabdumalagINQ Follow our live updates here: https://t.co/FV0VxxJW2J NOW: President Ferdinand Marcos Jr. welcomes Brazilian President Luiz Inácio Lula da Silva at the Philippine International Convention Center in Pasay City. Lula arrived in Manila on Friday for a two-day state visit and to attend the 49th Asean Summit and Related Summits on November 15 to 17. | 🎥: MPC Pool via @luisacabatoINQ Follow our live updates here: https://t.co/FV0VxxKtSh 🌾 FEEDING ASEAN’S FUTURE: How can Southeast Asia strengthen food security while ensuring that farmers and producers benefit? | 📸: Jose Antonio J. Lichauco / Business Inquirer https://t.co/krjF9tKmXy 🌾 FEEDING ASEAN’S FUTURE: How can Southeast Asia strengthen food security while ensuring that farmers and producers benefit? | 📸: Jose Antonio J. Lichauco / Business Inquirer https://t.co/krjF9tKmXy 🌾 FEEDING ASEAN’S FUTURE: How can Southeast Asia strengthen food security while ensuring that farmers and producers benefit? | 📸: Jose Antonio J. Lichauco / Business Inquirer https://t.co/krjF9tKmXy NOW: President Ferdinand Marcos Jr. holds a bilateral meeting with Canadian Prime Minister Mark Carney ahead of the 49th Asean and Related Summits. 🎥 MPC pool @inquirerdotnet https://t.co/IUHPMxbQaQ CANADIAN PM CARNEY ARRIVES IN MANILA FOR ASEAN SUMMIT LOOK: Canadian Prime Minister Mark Carney arrived in Manila on Saturday, Nov. 14, to participate in the 49th Asean Summit and Related Summits from Nov. 15 to 17. ( 📸 Screengrab from Asean Philippines 2026 / Youtube video) https://t.co/Vqc6MiwY2J LOOK: Cambodian Deputy Prime Minister Hang Chuon Naron arrived in Manila on Saturday, Nov. 14, to participate in the 49th Asean Summit and Related Summits scheduled for Nov. 15 to 17. (📸 Screengrab from Asean Philippines 2026/YouTube) | @inquirerdotnet https://t.co/H97NTWi8pc",
