   "title": "ICT ministry to inspect domestic disruptions after Microsoft services outage",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/business/20261114/ict-ministry-to-inspect-domestic-disruptions-after-microsoft-services-outage",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
