   "_dt": 1794646022.0,
   "ageDays": 0.01,
   "summary": "The ICT ministry said Saturday it will inspect disruptions to domestic companies' operations following a global outage of tech giant Microsoft's services. Microsoft 365 services experienced disruptions earlier this week, with some companies in the country reporting difficulty accessing their emails Friday. The Ministry of Science and ICT said it plans to check the restoration of the company's services and possible damage to users in South Korea by working with Microsoft Korea.",
   "summary_zh": "韩国信息通信技术部星期六表示，在科技巨头微软的服务发生全球性中断后，将检查国内企业运营受到的影响。Microsoft 365 服务本周早些时候出现中断，韩国一些企业报告称，星期五无法正常访问电子邮件。科学技术与信息通信技术部表示，计划与韩国微软合作，核查该公司服务的恢复情况以及用户可能遭受的损害。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "The ICT ministry said Saturday it will inspect disruptions to domestic companies' operations following a global outage of tech giant Microsoft's services. Microsoft 365 services experienced disruptions earlier this week, with some companies in the country reporting difficulty accessing their emails Friday. The Ministry of Science and ICT said it plans to check the restoration of the company's services and possible damage to users in South Korea by working with Microsoft Korea. It added that it will form a joint emergency response team with the company to continue monitoring the situation",
   "bodyLevel": "fulltext",
