   "title": "[COVER STORY] 'It feels like coming home': Korean War veterans revisit US Army base after 70 years",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/southkorea/defense/20261114/cover-story-it-feels-like-coming-home-korean-war-veterans-revisit-us-army-base-after-70-years",
