   "title": "With only 20,000 Korean War veterans still alive, gov't steps up efforts to preserve their stories",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/southkorea/defense/20261114/with-only-20000-korean-war-veterans-still-alive-govt-steps-up-efforts-to-preserve-their-stories",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
