   "title": "Infrastructure development creates jobs, boosts industry and helps fight poverty: PM Modi",
   "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/cities/bangalore/we-are-continuously-scoring-centuries-pm-narendra-modi-tells-karnataka-cm-as-bengalurus-namma-metro-crosses-100-km-mark/article71697376.ece",
