   "title": "Mahadev betting app case: CBI searches in 6 States lead to recovery of digital devices, key documents",
   "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/mahadev-betting-app-case-cbi-searches-in-6-states-lead-to-recovery-of-digital-devices-key-documents/article71701007.ece",
