   "title": "We’re Making Local Economies Work In Imo",
   "url": "https://leadership.ng/were-making-local-economies-work-in-imo-uzodimma/",
   "domain": "leadership.ng",
   "source": "Leadership（尼日利亚）",
   "published": "Sat, 14 Nov 2026 05:48:17 +0000",
   "_dt": 1794635297.0,
   "ageDays": 0.14,
   "summary": "He said that unlike before when only the economies in the city centres were working, he changed the narrative by laying the foundations and by embarking on enterprise and investing in the people, thus stimulating the local economies. Uzodimma spoke in Lagos as the guest lecturer at the inaugural National Policy Dialogue of the Lagos Country Club with Government Leaders.",
   "summary_zh": "他说，过去只有市中心的经济体运作，而如今他通过奠定基础、开展企业活动并投资于人，改变了叙事，从而刺激了地方经济。Uzodimma在Lagos出席Lagos Country Club与政府领导层举行的首届National Policy Dialogue，并担任客座讲师。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "He said that unlike before when only the economies in the city centres were working, he changed the narrative by laying the foundations and by embarking on enterprise and investing in the people, thus stimulating the local economies. Uzodimma spoke in Lagos as the guest lecturer at the inaugural National Policy Dialogue of the Lagos Country Club with Government Leaders. He said his administration long realised that a local economy that gives young people a stake in peace is among the best security investments a government can make, hence the foundation it has laid in the state. The governor noted that to attract private capital, the government must provide the basics, including infrastructure, human capital and power. The governor also said that with the state paying the highest minimum wage of N104,000, the economies of the local governments and rural communities have been boosted. “A well-paid public workforce is one of the quickest ways to put money into circulation at the grassroots,” he argued. He attributed the economic success recorded by the state to the reforms by President Bola Tinubu, saying that resources reaching the states have substantially increased since the president removed fuel subsidy. We’ve got the edge. Get real-time reports, breaking scoops, and exclusive angles delivered straight to your phone. Don’t settle for stale news. Join LEADERSHIP NEWS on WhatsApp for 24/7 updates →",
