   "ageDays": 0.14,
   "summary": "Unlock these with Subscription Congress leader Priyanka Gandhi Vadra on Saturday (November 14, 2026) hailed Jawaharlal Nehru on his birth anniversary, saying the fact that he is still attacked by those who seek to destroy the Constitution and democracy more than 60 years after his death is a testament to his steadfast commitment to India. Paying tributes to India's first Prime Minister, the Wayanad MP said Nehru was that unique human being — a revolutionary, a visionary and a builder.",
   "summary_zh": "订阅即可解锁这些内容。国大党领导人普里扬卡·甘地·瓦德拉于2026年11月14日星期六在贾瓦哈拉尔·尼赫鲁诞辰纪念日之际向其致敬，表示在他去世60多年后，那些企图摧毁宪法和民主的人仍在攻击他，这证明了他对印度的坚定承诺。这位来自瓦亚nad 的议员向印度首任总理致敬，称尼赫鲁是一位独一无二的人——一名革命者、一位远见者、一位建设者。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "Account subscription benefits alongside Premium Stories, Editorials, Opinions and more. Unlock these with Subscription Congress leader Priyanka Gandhi Vadra on Saturday (November 14, 2026) hailed Jawaharlal Nehru on his birth anniversary, saying the fact that he is still attacked by those who seek to destroy the Constitution and democracy more than 60 years after his death is a testament to his steadfast commitment to India. Paying tributes to India's first Prime Minister, the Wayanad MP said Nehru was that unique human being — a revolutionary, a visionary and a builder. \"May his love for our country guide us for always,\" she added. Nehru was born on this day in 1889 in Allahabad (now Prayagraj). Comments have to be in English, and in full sentences. They cannot be abusive or personal. Please abide by our community guidelines for posting your comments. We have migrated to a new commenting platform. If you are already a registered user of The Hindu and logged in, you may continue to engage with our articles. If you do not have an account please register and login to post comments. Users can access their older comments by logging into their accounts on Vuukle",
