   "title": "S Jaishankar on India-US trade deal: 'Bulk of issues sorted, remaining concerns more on American side'",
   "url": "https://www.hindustantimes.com/india-news/most-remaining-issues-at-americas-end-jaishankar-on-india-us-trade-deals-status-htls-2026-101794632369661.html",
   "domain": "hindustantimes.com",
