   "title": "FBI says US has seized $1.2 bil. worth of cryptocurrency stolen from Binance",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/world/20261113/fbi-says-us-has-seized-12-bil-worth-of-cryptocurrency-stolen-from-binance",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
